      "content": "i just feel like i'm overreacting. if it was a stroke i'd be totally incapacitated, right? the drooping is barely even there and my speech is mostly fine, i'm just a little slow. i have some sumatriptan in my cabinet, would it be okay if i just took one of those and rested for a bit to see if it clears up? if it settles down in an hour i'll call a doctor, but i'd really rather not sit in an ER waiting room all night if it's just this migraine thing acting up again.",
